m all.\n\n# Doors — Sample_20261013_1_E2EOverwrite1791892443628_hbb88f2f8a5e9's axes\n\n[ ^Sample_20261013_1_E2EOverwrite1791892443628_hbb88f2f8a5e9::People — 1 speakers ] [ ^Sample_20261013_1_E2EOverwrite1791892443628_hbb88f2f8a5e9::Unplaced — 1 statements ]\nEach door expands to its complete axis, grouped again when it is long.\n\n### Expr_20261013_1_E2EOverwrite1791892443628_hbb88f2f8a5e9_1  (already in your context)\n\n\nserved: ^Expr_20261013_1_E2EOverwrite1791892443628_hbb88f2f8a5e9_1, ^Sample_20261013_1_E2EOverwrite1791892443628_hbb88f2f8a5e9\n(pass this list back as `have` on your next expand — content you already hold is then returned as a bare ^pointer, never re-sent)","positions":"","pin":"4709b19091e29a0aee96fb22b03b8f9f61f18e9f","positions_consult":"{\"positions\":[]}","context_bytes":4806},"live_run_id":"5652c5001cd9","at":"2026-10-13T11:55:12Z"}
